{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"The fusion is correct and helps every small/medium case, but at large scale its extra live accumulator reduces throughput enough to lose 3–6% versus the prior two-pass version. Before spending the last official verification, I’m doing an in-process timing check of launch geometry on a representative large tensor; this does not modify inputs or the harness. Then I’ll keep the best large-shape path and use the proven fused path where it wins."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_16","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python - <<'PY'\nimport torch, triton\nimport kernel\nM = 131072\nH = 2560\ngo = torch.empty((M, H), device='cuda', dtype=torch.bfloat16)\nnorm = torch.empty((M, H), device='cuda', dtype=torch.float32)\nrstd = torch.empty((M, 1), device='cuda', dtype=torch.float32)\nw = torch.empty((H,), device='cuda', dtype=torch.float32)\nout1 = torch.empty_like(go)\nout2 = torch.empty_like(go)\nfor group in (8, 16, 32):\n    nparts = triton.cdiv(M, group)\n    partials = torch.empty((nparts, H), device='cuda', dtype=torch.float32)\n    nr = triton.cdiv(nparts, 256)\n    reduced = torch.empty((nr, H), device='cuda', dtype=torch.float32)\n    for warps in (4, 8, 16):\n        def launch():\n            kernel._fused_rows_kernel[(nparts,)](go, norm, rstd, w, out1, out2, partials, n_rows=M, GROUP=group, BLOCK=4096, num_warps=warps)\n            kernel._reduce_partials_kernel[(nr, 80)](partials, reduced, n_partials=nparts, ROW_BLOCK=256, COL_BLOCK=32, num_warps=8)\n            kernel._dw_finish_kernel[(80,)](reduced, w, n_reduced=nr, COL_BLOCK=32, BLOCK=triton.next_power_of_2(nr), num_warps=4)\n        try:\n            ms = triton.testing.do_bench(launch, warmup=20, rep=50)\n            print('group', group, 'warps', warps, 'ms', ms)\n        except Exception as e:\n            print('group', group, 'warps', warps, 'ERROR', type(e).__name__, str(e)[:200])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
